he main line with 9...Be6 after our reply of Bg5.} 10.Bg5 10...Be6 {Black protects their queen from attack and tries to remain solid. We'll exchange bishops. Now it will be challenging for Black to defend the dark squares.} 11.Bxe7 {We have transposed to the 9...Be6 line.} *

